im]sase-168[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-168/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Honor local dismissal in the remote-attention reconciler[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]inbox-dismissal[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inbox-dismissal: stop reconcile_remote_attention_inbox from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]un-dismissing same-revision rows, mark and reverse only its own [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]auto-dismissals, and treat has_more pages as incomplete, with regression[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gateway attention inventory must not fail on busy hosts[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]inventory-row-cap[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inventory-row-cap: in sase-core, drop the 200 raw-row cap from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project_fleet_attention_inventory (paging bounds output) and pre-filter [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the gateway handler to actionable rows, with core and route tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Install on athena, dismiss the 8 rows, and verify[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]deploy-dismiss-verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after inbox-dismissal, inventory-row-cap[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]deploy-dismiss-verify: run sase update -y, restart pre-update TUIs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through their Quit/Restart panel, dismiss the remote-attention rows, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirm they stay dismissed, and verify via sase screenshot that ?8 is [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gone.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-168","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-168.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-168.1"},"source_run_id":"run-e3637cc3b6670069b29a24c1f804ee2e","started_at":"2026-09-22T14:08:19.415324+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"3ad9c3ff3b140f1b65e2c718b5aa7921715b4456fe982e53554955b2fdb4d164","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-168.1--mon/chat.md","size_bytes":5468},"commits":{"digest":"c03d9377fd21294ea433208868657e39a3b9c1ad6b9b8b9237d873b96556d2b8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-168.1--mon/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"1c303d1ce2eb6bd5f109e08274110400af977526aeaaf4fd4b4b969df654c8ea","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-168.1--mon/meta.json","size_bytes":751},"state":{"digest":"4c4c482dfa8690756e606ced77e9df484111d396f8a46c2b19991b428ae614b2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-168.1--mon/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-168.1--mon","local_name":"sase-168.1--mon","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-168","agent_clan_generation":"20260922100710","agent_session":"sase-168.1","agent_session_role":"mon","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-168.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","epic_bead_id":"sase-168","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-168.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"mon","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"sase-168.1"},"source_run_id":"run-fa74123ece4a5cfda3ac55e8b7235ca2","started_at":"2026-09-22T14:31:26.458264+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-168","bbugyi200.athena.sase-168.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-168.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-168.3","bbugyi200.a